@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@token = replace-me

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dev@example.com",
  "password": "replace-me"
}

### Criar receita
POST {{baseUrl}}/incomes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Salário",
  "amount": "3500.00",
  "periodicity": "MONTHLY",
  "valueType": "FIXED",
  "competence": "2026-09"
}

### Criar despesa
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Internet",
  "amount": "119.90",
  "classification": "ESSENTIAL",
  "periodicity": "MONTHLY",
  "valueType": "FIXED",
  "competence": "2026-09"
}

### Resumo mensal
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/monthly-summary?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
